title: Coordinate with the Jedi Council
subtitle: Make sure the Jedi act with the Senate, not alone.
is-card: true
tags: last_days
card-image: img/card_jedi.svg
view-if: finale and jedi_relation >= 60 and not ld_jedi_used_today
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; ld_jedi_used_today = 1; last_card_timer = ""
new-page: true

= Coordinate with the Jedi Council

The Jedi Council is deciding what to do about [+ pal_title +]. The Council trusts the Caucus enough to let the Senate be part of that decision.

- @do: Coordinate with the Jedi Council.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: senate_jedi_pact = 1; jedi_relation += 2; jedi_suspicion += 1.5 if evidence >= 6

Master Windu agrees: if the Jedi move against [+ pal_title +], a Senate delegation will stand with them and the Supreme Court will be told at once. [? if evidence >= 6 : The Caucus's evidence goes to the Council with the agreement. ?]
